OL,3,GNEWSAUK security criticised after USAF
OL,4,Aplanes removed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former military intelligence officer
OL,7,Fsaid Britain needed to "take the
OL,8,Fsecurity of our US allies far more
OL,9,Fseriously" after US Air Force aircraft
OL,10,Fwere withdrawn from two UK bases.
OL,12,FFrank Ledwidge said there must have
OL,13,Fbeen a "credible threat" to cause the
OL,14,FUS to remove military planes from RAF
OL,15,FMildenhall in Suffolk on Monday and
OL,16,FTuesday.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
