OL,3,GNEWSAUK security criticised after USAF
OL,4,Aplanes removed
OL,5,
OL,6,FReferring to previous incidents at RAF
OL,7,FFairford and RAF Brize Norton, he said:
OL,8,F"This is a third example in less than
OL,9,Ftwo years of bases being penetrated, or
OL,10,Fbecoming close to being penetrated, by
OL,11,Fhostile forces. It's embarrassing."
OL,13,FDowning Street has recently insisted
OL,14,FBritish airbases were safe and that
OL,15,Ftheir security was a "top priority".
